WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:16.909
Dad: Brenda's parents are going to pick you up at the bus station.

2
00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:22.648
Mom: Call us as soon as you arrive.

3
00:00:22.649 --> 00:00:25.848
Brian: Ready to go, Ricky?

4
00:00:25.849 --> 00:00:35.299
Ricky: Yeah, I've got everything.

5
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.817
Brian: This is so exciting.

6
00:00:37.818 --> 00:00:47.011
Ricky: We get to take the bus by ourselves!

7
00:00:47.012 --> 00:00:52.874
Dad: Here are your tickets, boys.

8
00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:56.680
Mom: You have to change buses once.

9
00:00:56.681 --> 00:01:00.782
Ricky: Going to New Mont. No problem.

10
00:01:00.783 --> 00:01:04.310
Dad: It's Newman.

11
00:01:04.311 --> 00:01:06.948
Ricky: Newman. Got it.

12
00:01:06.949 --> 00:01:09.970
Mom: Call us as soon as you arrive.

13
00:01:09.971 --> 00:01:18.234
Ricky: Don't worry. Everything will be fine.

14
00:01:18.235 --> 00:01:25.058
Dad: The bus driver will help you too.

15
00:01:25.059 --> 00:01:31.520
Ricky: Bye! I'll call you!

16
00:01:31.521 --> 00:01:40.973
Brian: Our adventure begins!
